{
  "title": "The Light in the Hills",
  "clock": null,
  "lines": [
    "Ravi waited on the roof.", "The light blinked again.", "Three short. Three long.", "It came from the hills.",
    "He crossed into the forest.", "The forest was burning.", "Smoke. Heat. No birds.",
    "Then the sky cracked open.", "Rain hit the fire.", "Steam swallowed the path.", "He ran blind through it.",
    "Something moved behind him.", "Footsteps. Matching his.", "He stopped.", "The footsteps didn't.",
    "The ground shook again...", "The light was just ahead.",
    "A door. A lamp. A voice.", "It said his name.", "But nobody here knew Ravi.", "So who was waiting for him?"
  ],
